OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of murdering
OL,4,Awife in Norfolk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of his wife who was
OL,8,Ffound dead at home.
OL,10,FThe body of 45-year-old GP Dr Hannah
OL,11,FTerry, also known as Hannah Cain, was
OL,12,Ffound at a property in Fern Hill in
OL,13,FDersingham, Norfolk, on Sunday.
OL,15,FMark Cain, 45, also of Fern Hill, was
OL,16,Fcharged with her murder on Tuesday.
OL,18,FHe appeared in a black sweatshirt at
OL,19,FNorwich Magistrates' Court, where he
OL,20,Fspoke only to confirm his age, name and
OL,21,Faddress.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
